            <div xml:id="d605">

                <pb facs="0632" n="620" sameAs="frus:frus1945v04/pg620"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">760D.6115/10–2745: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Finland</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Hulley</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Helsinki</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-10-27">October 27,
                        1945</date>.<lb/>[Received October 28—3:50 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>641. Press 27th. New Petsamo border which exactly same as between Russian Empire
                    and Grand Duchy of Finland has been delineated and documents reestablishing it
                    signed Helsinki 26th.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hulley</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
